data: {"id": "7d4b41de82c94c71-thinking-parallel_evidence-718", "run_id": "7d4b41de82c94c71", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，核心事实如下：\n\n- **Pod 身份**：`aiops-case-11/workload`，节点 `node2`，UID `6661a138-...-816219802`。\n- **Terminating 状态**：`deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`，已终止长达 91 分钟。\n- **Finalizer 阻塞**：`finalizers: [aiops.lab/hold]` —— 这是 Terminating 无法完成的直接原因，因为该 finalizer 未被释放。\n- **容器状态异常**：容器 `app` 已 `Terminated`，Exit Code **137** (OOM Killed / SIGKILL)，Restart Count **0**，且 `Ready=False` (ContainersNotReady)。\n- **节点状态**：Node `node2` 为 **Ready** 状态，排除了 Node NotReady 导致终止卡住的常见场景。\n- **事件为空**：Pod 事件查询无返回，", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788480175386, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

